k series. The EP was solely written and produced by the member Ayase.\n12 singles supported The Book For, including RIAJ-certified singles—Monogatari: Off & Monster Season's theme song \"Undead\" and 2024 NHK's sport event theme \"Butai ni Tatte\"—and a collaborative track with Overwatch, \"Orion\". Commercially, the EP peaked at number seven on the Oricon Albums Chart and the Billboard Japan Hot Albums.\n\nFrom Wikipedia ("},{"text":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Boo...","navigationEndpoint":{"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Book_For,","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}},{"text":") under Creative Commons Attribution CC-BY-SA 3.0 ("},{"text":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...","navigationEndpoint":{"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}},{"text":")"}]},"moreButton":{"toggleButtonRenderer":{"isToggled":false,"isDisabled":false,"defaultIcon":{"iconType":"EXPAND"},"defaultText":{"runs":[{"text":"More"}]},"toggledIcon":{"iconType":"COLLAPSE"},"toggledText":{"runs":[{"text":"Less"}]}}},"shelfStyle":"MUSIC_SHELF_STYLE_OPEN_DIALOG_ON_CLICK"}},"secondSubtitle":{"runs":[{"text":"12 songs"},{"text":" • "},{"text":"42 minutes"}]}}}]}}}}]}},"microformat":{"microformatDataRenderer":{"urlCanonical":"https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_mWC1ugXe9-rqQu8BeY9tRHqpXhHXKSagc","title":"THE BOOK for,","description":"Album • YOASOBI","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/uAnpbMTheIqqAf28jG8nZHDIrjmAzJATXhq0eowBsvFGacUMAweVeBxjC2TOFvje_hYbQOqSkGVvDZo2Bw=w544-h544-l90-rj","width":544,"height":544}]},"siteName":"YouTube Music","appName":"YouTube Music","androidPackage":"com.google.android.apps.youtube.music","iosAppStoreId":"1017492454","ogType":"music.album","urlApplinksWeb":"https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_mWC1ugXe9-rqQu8BeY9tRHqpXhHXKSagc&feature=applinks","urlApplinksIos":"vnd.youtube.music://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5u